  "translation": "Today is the weekend. My friend and I went to the supermarket together to buy things. We first went to the fruit section. The fruit section is inside the supermarket. There are many apples and bananas there. My friend asked me: 'What do you want to buy?' I said: 'I want to buy some apples, and also want to buy milk.' Later we went to the bread section. The bread is on the shelf. My friend said: 'I can make bread.' I took two pieces of bread, and my friend took a cup of yogurt. Finally we went to the cashier to pay. The cashier said the total is fifty yuan. I gave her one hundred yuan, and she gave me fifty yuan change. We were very happy and went home together."
